  m_text: "The game is played by voice, so the microphone stays open for the whole
    interrogation. Each utterance you speak is sent over an encrypted connection
    to be transcribed and read for tone, then thrown away \u2014 never written to
    disk. Nothing you say is used to train any model, and no name, email, or account
    is ever collected."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
